      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not erased; you are simply the only one who remembers the weight of the house because you carried it. The person who lived here is still there, breathing, watching over you, waiting for you to wake up and realize that your life is still worth living. You don't need to face a tomorrow filled with nothingness; you need to face a tomorrow where you finally get to be the person you were meant to be, not the hollow shell you've been pretending to be. The silence isn't empty; it's waiting for the sound of your own voice again.",
